rder-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">来</span>玩 <span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">不</span>然<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">会</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">生</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">气</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">yāo nǐ lái wán bùrán huì shēngqì</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">놀러 오라고 초대합니다, 안 그러면 화낼 거예요.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 生气가 会 뒤에 붙어 &#x27;화낼 것이다&#x27;라는 앞으로의 일을 말하고 있습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">生气</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">shēngqì</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">화가 나다, 화내다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">会</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">huì</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">~할 것이다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">来</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">lái</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">오다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">玩</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">wán</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">놀다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">不然</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">bùrán</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">그렇지 않으면</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day50-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day50-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE8tdlQ0a29oSHRPUU9uaFo5dlQ5UllnOHNtaDZNU0J6UzUzZC1YV1AtMWlvR2RPUVRvaGVTSFYyVmRZUEpkVE10UWZGem5nbEthaFBBUHJn?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">微博</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">高兴</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">gāoxìng</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">기쁘다, 즐겁다 (형용사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">累</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">lèi</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">피곤하다, 지치다 (형용사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">爱</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">ài</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">사랑하다, 몹시 좋아하다 (동사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">生气</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">shēngqì</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">화가 나다, 화내다 (동사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">高</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">gāo</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">높다, (키가) 크다 (형용사)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:30px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">지난 수업</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/?p=2723\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#8C6423;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all\">← 打电话·喂·手机 전화 중국어 5마디 (중국어 49일차)</a></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-top:8px\">하루 한 편씩 쌓는 중입니다. 오늘이 50일차입니다. <a href=\"https://daytip.kr/chinese-course/\" style=\"color:#8C6423\">전체 목차 →</a></div>\n</div>\n",
